<h1 id="grok-bot-tutor">Grok Bot Tutor<a class="headerlink" href="#grok-bot-tutor" title="Permanent link">&para;</a></h1>
<p><a href="https://x.ai/bot/3JTODK3i9jilU1aOo0gCo">Data 8 Tutor by Benjamin</a>
is a hosted Data 8 tutor for UC Berkeley students. On first use it sets up
the Spring 2026 course materials on its own cloud computer. After that it
gives hints, cites lectures and the textbook, and is instructed not to hand
over solution code or answer keys.</p>
<p>Unlike the self-hosted CLI, Discord, and Slack options, you do not install
the tutor locally or import a course archive yourself.</p>
<div class="guide-actions">
<p><a class="md-button md-button--primary" href="https://x.ai/bot/3JTODK3i9jilU1aOo0gCo">Add Data 8 Tutor to Grok Bot</a></p>
</div>
<div class="outline-grid">
<div class="outline-card">
<p><span class="twemoji outline-card__icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M14 3v2h3.59l-9.83 9.83 1.41 1.41L19 6.41V10h2V3m-2 16H5V5h7V3H5a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v14a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h14a2 2 0 0 0 2-2v-7h-2z"/></svg></span></p>
<h3 id="add-the-template">Add the template<a class="headerlink" href="#add-the-template" title="Permanent link">&para;</a></h3>
<p>Open the shared tutor and add a copy to your Grok Bot account.</p>
</div>
<div class="outline-card">
<p><span class="twemoji outline-card__icon"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M6.5 20q-2.28 0-3.89-1.57Q1 16.85 1 14.58q0-1.95 1.17-3.48 1.18-1.53 3.08-1.95.43-1.8 2.13-3.42Q9.07 4.1 11 4.1q.83 0 1.41.59.59.59.59 1.41v6.05l1.6-1.55L16 12l-4 4-4-4 1.4-1.4 1.6 1.55V6.1q-1.9.35-2.95 1.84T7 11h-.5q-1.45 0-2.47 1.03Q3 13.05 3 14.5T4.03 17q1.02 1 2.47 1h12q1.05 0 1.77-.73.73-.72.73-1.77t-.73-1.77Q19.55 13 18.5 13H17v-2q0-1.2-.55-2.24Q15.9 7.73 15 7V4.68q1.85.87 2.93 2.58Q19 9 19 11q1.73.2 2.86 1.5 1.14 1.28 1.14 3 0 1.88-1.31 3.19T18.5 20M12 11.05"/></svg></span></p>
<h3 id="let-first-use-setup-finish">Let first-use setup finish<a class="headerlink" href="#let-first-use-setup-finish" title="Permanent link">&para;</a></h3>
<p>The tutor downloads and stores Spring 2026 course materials on its own
computer. You do not paste a setup prompt or provide local files.</p>
</div>
